    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d190">

                <pb facs="0287" n="211" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg211"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.21/327</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Thomson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 26, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Colombian Government and public growing restless and impatient at the delay of
                    the Senate in considering the Colombian treaty. I have received long and
                    forceful note from Minister of Foreign Affairs urging action. Special message
                    from the President at the earliest practical moment will relieve tension.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
